  ### Decoded Flag

  Most picoCTF challenges expect lowercase:

    picoCTF{m0rs3c0d31sfun8480af96}

  If lowercase fails, try:

  • Uppercase: picoCTF{M0RS3C0D31SFUN8480AF96}
  • With underscores: picoCTF{m0rs3_c0d3_1s_fun_8480af96}
